  "openings": [
    {
      "topic": "P1",
      "package": "r16",
      "language": "ko",
      "body_codepoints": 420,
      "comment_codepoints": 143,
      "first_two_nonempty_file_lines": [
        "대만에서 계약서 쓰기 전에 집 계약금부터 보냈다가, 마음 바꿔서 돌려 달라고 소송 낸 사람이 졌어요.",
        "법원 얘기는, 집 보면서 월세랑 기간을 말로 다 맞췄으니 서명 전이어도 계약은 된 거래요."
      ],
      "first_two_file_lines_codepoints": 107,
      "comment_question": "집 구할 때 계약서부터 썼어요, 돈부터 보냈어요?"
    },
    {
      "topic": "P1",
      "package": "r16",
      "language": "zh-TW",
      "body_codepoints": 243,
      "comment_codepoints": 139,
      "first_two_nonempty_file_lines": [
        "租約還沒簽，看完房先匯了訂金，反悔想拿回來，告上法院一審輸了",
        "法官認為看房那天租金、租期都講好了，租約當天就成立"
      ],
      "first_two_file_lines_codepoints": 56,
      "comment_question": "你們付訂金的時候，對方有先講「不租就沒收」嗎？"
    },
    {
      "topic": "P1",
      "package": "r16",
      "language": "ja",
      "body_codepoints": 373,
      "comment_codepoints": 145,
      "first_two_nonempty_file_lines": [
        "部屋の契約書にサインする前に、手付金を振り込んだ人の話。気が変わって返してほしいと台湾で裁判を起こしたけど、負けました。",
        "裁判所の判断だと、内見の日に家賃と期間を口で決めた時点で、契約はもう成立していた。"
      ],
      "first_two_file_lines_codepoints": 102,
      "comment_question": "台湾の部屋探し、手付金と契約書、どっちが先でした？"
    },
    {
      "topic": "P1",
      "package": "r16",
      "language": "en",
      "body_codepoints": 496,
      "comment_codepoints": 200,
      "first_two_nonempty_file_lines": [
        "Someone in Taipei wired a holding deposit before signing a lease, then wanted out hours later. They sued for it and lost.",
        "The lease already existed, the court said, since rent and a one-year minimum were settled verbally at the viewing."
      ],
      "first_two_file_lines_codepoints": 236,
      "comment_question": "Anyone here paid a deposit in Taiwan before seeing an actual lease?"
    },
    {
      "topic": "P2",
      "package": "c13-r3",
      "language": "ko",
      "body_codepoints": 437,
      "comment_codepoints": 145,
      "first_two_nonempty_file_lines": [
        "부부가 같이 가서 이혼 등록까지 마쳤는데, 대만 법원이 그 이혼은 무효라고 했어요.",
        "서류에 서명한 증인 두 명 중 한 명이 남편한테 정말 이혼할 건지 직접 확인한 적이 없어서요."
      ],
      "first_two_file_lines_codepoints": 99,
      "comment_question": "친구가 이혼 서류에 증인 서명 좀 해 달라고 하면, 해 줄 것 같아요?"
    },
    {
      "topic": "P2",
      "package": "c13-r3",
      "language": "zh-TW",
      "body_codepoints": 241,
      "comment_codepoints": 128,
      "first_two_nonempty_file_lines": [
        "夫妻一起去戶政事務所辦完離婚登記，法院卻判這個離婚無效",
        "因為兩位證人裡，有一位從來沒跟先生本人確認過他到底要不要離婚"
      ],
      "first_two_file_lines_codepoints": 58,
      "comment_question": "有沒有人被朋友拜託過，當離婚協議書的證人？"
    },
    {
      "topic": "P2",
      "package": "c13-r3",
      "language": "ja",
      "body_codepoints": 407,
      "comment_codepoints": 140,
      "first_two_nonempty_file_lines": [
        "夫婦そろって役所で離婚の手続きまで済ませたのに、台湾の裁判所の答えは「この離婚は無効。2人はまだ夫婦」。",
        "引っかかったのは証人。サインした2人のうち1人が、夫に本当に離婚するのか一度も確かめていなかった。"
      ],
      "first_two_file_lines_codepoints": 102,
      "comment_question": "友だちに離婚届の証人を頼まれたら、相手の方にも話を聞きます？"
    },
    {
      "topic": "P2",
      "package": "c13-r3",
      "language": "en",
      "body_codepoints": 495,
      "comment_codepoints": 216,
      "first_two_nonempty_file_lines": [
        "He and his wife signed and registered their divorce. Then he sued, and a Taiwan court said they were still married.",
        "A divorce like that needs two or more witnesses. One of theirs never asked him if he really wanted out."
      ],
      "first_two_file_lines_codepoints": 219,
      "comment_question": "Would you sign as a witness on a friend's divorce papers without talking to the other spouse?"
    },
    {
      "topic": "P3",
      "package": "c09-r2",
      "language": "ko",
      "body_codepoints": 392,
      "comment_codepoints": 151,
      "first_two_nonempty_file_lines": [
        "타이베이에서 빨간불에 그냥 들어온 버스 옆구리에, 아이를 태운 오토바이가 부딪힌 사고.",
        "1심 법원은 아이 앞니 치료비는 달라는 대로 다 인정했는데, 부모가 일 못 한 손해는 청구한 돈의 10분의 1도 안 쳐 줬어요."
      ],
      "first_two_file_lines_codepoints": 120,
      "comment_question": "사고 나서 일 쉬어 본 분, 그동안 못 번 돈은 어떻게 했어요?"
    },
    {
      "topic": "P3",
      "package": "c09-r2",
      "language": "zh-TW",
      "body_codepoints": 284,
      "comment_codepoints": 151,
      "first_two_nonempty_file_lines": [
        "大客車闖紅燈，跟家長載著孩子的機車撞在一起",
        "一審判下來，孩子門牙的治療費要多少就認多少，家長養傷不能工作的損失，連要的一成都不到"
      ],
      "first_two_file_lines_codepoints": 64,
      "comment_question": "騎車被撞過的人，那段沒辦法上班的收入，後來是拿什麼證明的？"
    },
    {
      "topic": "P3",
      "package": "c09-r2",
      "language": "ja",
      "body_codepoints": 350,
      "comment_codepoints": 160,
      "first_two_nonempty_file_lines": [
        "赤信号を無視した大型バスに、親子2人乗りのバイクがぶつかった台北の事故。裁判所は、子どもの前歯の治療費は全額認めたのに、親が仕事を休んだ分は請求の1割も認めませんでした。",
        "親の側から、収入の明細も税務申告も出ていなかったんです。"
      ],
      "first_two_file_lines_codepoints": 114,
      "comment_question": "けがで仕事を休んで、その分を相手に請求したことがある方。収入は何で証明しました？"
    },
    {
      "topic": "P3",
      "package": "c09-r2",
      "language": "en",
      "body_codepoints": 481,
      "comment_codepoints": 215,
      "first_two_nonempty_file_lines": [
        "A bus ran a red light in Taipei, and a scooter carrying a parent and kid hit its side. A district court gave the kid the full amount claimed for dental work. The parent got under a tenth of their lost-income claim. They never turned in income records or tax returns.",
        "The kid had four upper front teeth knocked out or snapped. The defense said a cheaper option would do. The judge went with the implant plan anyway, since the kid was still a minor and teeth shape how a face looks."
      ],
      "first_two_file_lines_codepoints": 480,
      "comment_question": "If you've had to prove lost income after getting hurt in Taiwan, what did you use?"
    }
  ],
